      "headline": "Fall of the Kamakura Shogunate",
      "text": "The Kamakura Shogunate falls after the defeat of the Hōjō clan by forces loyal to Emperor Go-Daigo, leading to the brief restoration of imperial rule."
    },
    {
      "date": "1336",
      "headline": "Establishment of the Ashikaga Shogunate",
      "text": "Ashikaga Takauji establishes the Ashikaga Shogunate, also known as the Muromachi Shogunate, after defeating Emperor Go-Daigo's forces."
    },
    {
      "date": "1573",
      "headline": "End of the Ashikaga Shogunate",
