      "headline": "Marriage to Francis, Dauphin of France",
      "text": "Mary married Francis, the Dauphin of France, strengthening the alliance between Scotland and France."
    },
    {
      "date": "1559-07-10",
      "headline": "Queen Consort of France",
      "text": "Mary became Queen Consort of France when her husband, Francis, ascended to the French throne as King Francis II."
    },
    {
      "date": "1560-12-05",
      "headline": "Death of Francis II",
      "text": "Mary's husband, King Francis II of France, died, leaving her a widow at the age of 18."
    },
    {
      "date": "1561-08-19",
      "headline": "Return to Scotland",
      "text": "Mary returned to Scotland to assume her role as the reigning monarch after the death of her husband."
    },
