      "headline": "Marriage to Henry Stuart, Lord Darnley",
      "text": "Mary married her cousin Henry Stuart, Lord Darnley, which caused political unrest due to his claim to the English throne."
    },
    {
      "date": "1566-06-19",
      "headline": "Birth of James VI and I",
      "text": "Mary gave birth to her only child, James, who would later become King James VI of Scotland and James I of England."
    },
