      "headline": "Murder of Lord Darnley",
      "text": "Mary's husband, Lord Darnley, was found murdered under mysterious circumstances, leading to scandal and suspicion."
    },
    {
      "date": "1567-05-15",
      "headline": "Marriage to James Hepburn, Earl of Bothwell",
